lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校研究证实：GPT-4.5在图灵测试中胜率超越真人</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特朗普紧急叫停美国AI监管行政令，马斯克与扎克伯格联手施压游说</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ca966cf5e5c71fe3981b4ab8175d3235.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国总统特朗普于周四突然取消原定签署的AI行政令，该法令旨在加强政府对人工智能的监管。此次叫停的核心原因在于科技界大佬的幕后干预，Meta CEO扎克伯格与xAI创始人马斯克在签署仪式前夕与特朗普直接通话，联合白宫AI顾问大卫·萨克斯表达强烈反对，认为严苛监管将阻碍美国AI行业的全球领先优势。特朗普本人亦公开表示，担心该行政令条款会成为行业发展的绊脚石。除外部游说外，白宫内部也存在严重分歧，网络安全局等部门对草案中赋予财政部的主导权表示不满。此外，草案中要求企业在发布模型前提前最多90天向政府共享数据的规定，引发了关于安全测试及技术竞争力的争议。目前白宫内部“加速派”占据上风，该行政令文本因各方利益博弈陷入停滞，短期内难以推进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱发布GLM-5.1高速版API，实现400 tokens/s全球领先推理速度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，智谱正式面向企业客户发布GLM-5.1高速版API（GLM-5.1-highspeed）。该模型在保持旗舰级基座能力的同时，实测输出速度达到400 tokens/s，刷新全球大模型官方API速度上限。产品支持200K超长上下文窗口，最大单次输出达128K tokens。技术层面，智谱GLM团队与TileRT团队联合重构了系统级推理生态，通过TileRT架构重写、动态批处理与KV Cache调度优化，以及基础设施层集群协同，实现了性能突破。该模型现已通过智谱MaaS平台向部分企业客户定向开放。此举旨在解决高频交互场景下的延迟瓶颈，赋能AI编程、实时语音、3D游戏及多智能体（Multi-Agent）并行推演等领域，使企业无需在模型智能度与响应速度之间进行妥协，加速软件生态向智能体化迭代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校研究证实：GPT-4.5在图灵测试中胜率超越真人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/69056aa44007a63af553be961b3a49ab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校在《美国国家科学院院刊》发表研究，证实顶尖大语言模型已通过经典三方图灵测试。实验中，GPT-4.5在特定人格提示下被判定为人类的胜率达73%，显著超越真人志愿者；开源模型LLaMa-3.1-405B胜率达56%，与人类表现持平。研究指出，AI获胜的关键在于学会了模拟人类的幽默感、易错性及社会行为特征，而非单纯比拼逻辑智商。若缺乏针对性提示，GPT-4.5与LLaMa-3.1的胜率则分别降至36%与38%。该研究引发行业对网络信任危机的担忧，专家警告称，AI已具备完美伪装能力，极易被恶意利用于社交欺诈或操纵舆论。研究团队建议，未来需加速部署更严苛的数字身份验证与AI生成内容防伪机制，以应对AI带来的社会安全风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29f544e819c801a31e134d098bfbc4a8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，OpenAI 正式推出 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件（Beta版），该插件已嵌入 PowerPoint 底层架构，面向全球所有 ChatGPT 用户（含免费账号）开放。该工具支持三大核心场景：通过自然语言指令一键生成 PPT 大纲与初稿；对现有页面进行文案润色与配色调整；以及主动识别内容逻辑缺口并预判汇报提问的“揪 Bug”功能。为确保安全性，插件引入了“人在回路（Human-in-the-loop）”机制，针对结构大改等关键操作强制要求人工确认。此次原生接入打破了以往 AI 生成工具需“复制粘贴”的割裂体验，标志着办公生产力工具从手动操作转向“智能体协作”模式，用户可通过 PowerPoint 插件商店搜索并激活使用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Comscore发布2026年3月美国桌面端消费级AI聊天机器人市场报告，全美AI平台独立用户达4440万，环比增长超21%。OpenAI旗下ChatGPT以3386万独立访客稳居榜首，环比增长18.9%；谷歌Gemini以1066万访客位列第二，环比增长29.1%；微软Copilot以502万访客位居第三，环比增幅达44.4%。Anthropic旗下Claude表现最为抢眼，以266万独立访客位列第四，环比增速高达130.1%，成为市场最强劲的挑战者。榜单后三位分别为X Grok（165万）、DeepSeek（41万）及Perplexity（36万）。数据表明，尽管头部梯队优势明显，但以Claude为代表的后方梯队正以高增速重塑市场竞争格局，桌面端AI服务的用户渗透率持续保持强劲增长态势。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
